      "Requirements enforce count of distinct working facilities by type at minLevel or above.",
      "No facility is consumed or exclusively reserved while a model is being researched.",
      "All working NII and KB of any level contribute to a shared monthly RP pool.",
      "At most one NII per eligible developed city and one KB per eligible machinery factory.",
      "A model requires one already researched incoming predecessor (OR), historical earliest year, and all facility requirements (AND).",
      "When requirements become false, ongoing research is paused without losing progress.",
      "Pre-1950 research nodes may be unlocked as scenario initial technology without spending RP.",
      "Research tree is target design, runtime currently uses calendar-only unlocks."
